; The Court's boss (.ai/endgame-castle.md 5.6): the steward of the house with his white staff of
; office. He fights with the staff (a ring) and his household (a rank called across the room), and at
; 75%, 50% and 25% he leaves through a servants' door for another room, to be found
; (CourtSeneschalBoss.cs). A tall man, not a brute: narrower than the Warden of the Deep, a walk a
; little quicker than Elderbark's so a player who runs from him is followed. Health and the Arcane
; bonus are BossCatalog's [12] block.
